---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { Layers, Brain, Activity, FileCheck, Map, Award, BookOpen, Compass, Sparkles, Briefcase, Users, Tag } from 'lucide-astro';
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

import amitTripathiImg from '../../assets/amit_tripathi.jpg';
---

<PageLayout
  title="For Commercial Explorers — AI Resource Exploration"
  description="AI-augmented mineral targeting built for geologists who have to defend the discovery — NI 43-101 and JORC-aligned outputs, founded on 30 years of field practice across 60+ projects in 20+ countries."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-geo-slate text-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-5">For Commercial Explorers</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-white leading-[1.08] mb-6">
        Built for the geologist who has to defend the discovery.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-prose mx-auto mb-8">
        Ranked exploration target portfolios calibrated against peer-reviewed deposit models. Outputs structured for NI 43-101 and JORC reporting. Authored by a founder with 30+ years of multidisciplinary field experience. If your board is asking <em>why these targets and not those</em>, this is the tool that gives you the answer in writing.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded bg-geo-gold text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-amber-500 transition-colors text-center"
        >
          Request a Capabilities Brief →
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded border border-white/20 text-white/80 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
        >
          Email us a project brief
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Time Pressure -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-geo-deep">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">The Time Pressure</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-6 leading-tight">Your data room is years deep. Your window is months wide.</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-prose mx-auto mb-8">
        Most listed explorers sit on decades of satellite imagery, geochemistry, geophysics and drill data that cost tens of millions to acquire. Manual reinterpretation across modern AI methods takes a 3–5-person team six to twelve months per project. Your option deadlines, drill-permit windows, and equity-raise cycles do not wait that long.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-300 italic text-base md:text-lg max-w-prose mx-auto">
        CAGE-IN compresses early exploration from years to weeks — and the targets it surfaces are referenced to peer-reviewed deposit models a QP can defend in print.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why CAGE-IN -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-geo-slate">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">Why CAGE-IN</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-4 leading-tight">Production methodology. Peer-reviewed foundations. Geologist judgement.</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-prose mx-auto">
          Three structural reasons your QP will sign the deliverable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-gold/15 text-geo-gold flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Layers size={22} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white font-semibold mb-3 leading-snug">Peer-reviewed deposit models</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Twelve deposit-model categories — porphyry, epithermal, IOCG, skarn, IRG, laterite Ni, Ni sulphide, SEDEX, orogenic Au, graphite, VMS, diamond kimberlite — calibrated against the published prospectivity literature. Every weighting tied to a citation a QP can follow.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-gold/15 text-geo-gold flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Brain size={22} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white font-semibold mb-3 leading-snug">Multi-method, cross-validated</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Three independent scoring engines — knowledge-driven WLC, machine-learning RF with spatial-block CV, ensemble fusion — converge on a single ranked output, with a Conflict Map that exposes disagreement zones for geologist review. Cross-validated on Nevada, Titiribi, Rajasthan, and Uganda terrains.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-gold/15 text-geo-gold flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Activity size={22} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white font-semibold mb-3 leading-snug">AI-backed fluid software</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Your model is not frozen at delivery. As the peer-reviewed literature evolves, the reasoning inside CAGE-IN updates with it. The targets you commission today stay defensible against the science of tomorrow.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-10" data-reveal>
        <a href="/technologies/cage-in" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-geo-gold text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
          Read the full technical brief →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reporting-Aligned -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-geo-deep">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">Reporting-Aligned</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-4 leading-tight">Outputs your QP can sign.</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-prose mx-auto">
          Every deliverable is structured for downstream NI 43-101 and JORC reporting. Citations are bibliography-resolved. Confidence scoring is per-target. Methodology is traceable end-to-end.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4" data-reveal>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Spatial</p>
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Composite score raster</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">0–1 NaN-aware weighted average over the AOI</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Targets</p>
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Anomaly polygons (GeoPackage)</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Area / perimeter / circularity / mean+max score / shape-compatibility rank attributes</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Probability</p>
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Three probability surfaces</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Method A, Method B, and Ensemble outputs side-by-side</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Transparency</p>
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Method A/B Conflict Map</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Disagreement zones surfaced for geologist review — the failure-mode honesty an auditor expects</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Imagery</p>
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">RGB composites + Crosta PCA</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Spectral evidence layers ready for QGIS inspection and report inclusion</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Narrative</p>
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Optional report draft</p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Geological narrative constrained to bibliography-resolved citations — first-pass authoring, not auto-publish</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder credentials -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-geo-slate">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-start" data-reveal>
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute -inset-3 rounded-full bg-geo-secondary/10 hidden lg:block"></div>
            <Image
              src={amitTripathiImg}
              alt="Dr. Amit Tripathi"
              width={320}
              class="relative w-48 h-48 sm:w-64 sm:h-64 lg:w-80 lg:h-80 rounded-full object-cover shadow-xl border-4 border-white/20"
            />
            <div class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 w-12 h-12 lg:w-20 lg:h-20 rounded-full bg-geo-gold/15 border-2 border-geo-gold/30"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal>
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">30+ Years in the Field</p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-6 leading-tight">The geologist behind your discovery.</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Dr. Amit Tripathi has spent three decades on mineral-exploration programs across five continents — uranium, REE, gold, PGE, diamond, nickel, COLTAN, iron, and base-metal terrains. He authored CAGE-IN to encode the way an experienced exploration geologist actually combines multi-disciplinary signals to rank targets, then made that reasoning available as software so smaller teams can reach the same calibre of deliverable.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
            <div>
              <p class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-geo-gold">30+</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Years in mineral exploration</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-geo-gold">60+</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Projects delivered</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-geo-gold">20+</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Countries across 5 continents</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-geo-gold">22+</p>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Peer-reviewed publications</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-geo-gold text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
            Read the full biography →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Living Methodology callout -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-16 bg-geo-deep">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-reveal>
      <div class="bg-geo-gold/8 border border-geo-gold/30 border-l-8 border-l-geo-gold rounded p-8">
        <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">Living Methodology</p>
        <p class="font-display italic text-white text-xl md:text-2xl leading-snug mb-4">
          The model you commission today is the model you keep — kept current with the literature, not frozen at delivery.
        </p>
        <a href="/technologies/cage-in#living-methodology" class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
          See how CAGE-IN stays current →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-geo-slate">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">How We Work</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-4 leading-tight">Three engagement shapes. All Western-standard.</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-prose mx-auto">
          Mutual NDA at first call. Data-room access on standard confidentiality terms. Full IP confidentiality throughout. The shape you pick reflects how much of the workflow you want to own.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-primary/20 text-geo-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Briefcase size={22} />
          </div>
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Project-Based</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white font-semibold mb-3 leading-snug">Per-AOI deliverable</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Fixed-scope engagement on a defined Area of Interest. We deliver a ranked target portfolio with confidence scoring, QGIS-loaded outputs, and a methodology brief your QP can attach to the technical report. Best for: drill-program prioritisation, option-evaluation, M&amp;A due-diligence reads on a target asset.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-primary/20 text-geo-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Users size={22} />
          </div>
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">Embedded Advisor</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white font-semibold mb-3 leading-snug">Retainer technical advisor</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Recurring monthly engagement with your exploration team. We run CAGE-IN against new datasets as they arrive, support QP review, brief your board on technical milestones, and stay close enough to call before drilling moves. Best for: explorers running active programs who want senior judgement on tap without a full-time hire.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-dark rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-primary/20 text-geo-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Tag size={22} />
          </div>
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-2">White-Label</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white font-semibold mb-3 leading-snug">Embedded licence</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            For consultancies and in-house teams who want to operate CAGE-IN under their own brand. We licence the stack, train your team on the geological reasoning behind every model, and stay behind the scenes. Your client relationship stays yours; the deliverable lands sharper than your last one.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA banner -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-24 bg-geo-slate text-white relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #fff 0, #fff 1px, transparent 0, transparent 50%); background-size: 30px 30px;"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Brief Us</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-6 leading-tight">Tell us about the project. We'll tell you what CAGE-IN finds.</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto mb-8">
        30 minutes on a call with Dr. Tripathi. We will walk your AOI, your existing data inventory, and where CAGE-IN could shorten your timeline — at no cost and under NDA from the first message.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-5">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded bg-geo-gold text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-amber-500 transition-colors"
        >
          Request a Capabilities Brief →
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded border border-white/20 text-white/80 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
        >
          Email us a project brief
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest">Mutual NDA from first message · Confidentiality maintained throughout</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
